    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107113" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεκχωρ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>withdraw, retire,</i> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ
				τῆς Ἀττικῆς</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.13
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τοῦ βίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					785b
				</span></i>
			: c. dat., <i>retire and give place to</i> another, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				103d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τῷ θανάτῳ</span>
			<i>make way for</i> death, <i>and so escape,</i> ib. <i><span class="en">
				106e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be purged,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὴν φάρμακόν τις πιὼν κάτω καὶ ἄνω
					ὑπεκχωρέῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Loc.Hom.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			.</div>
